  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "横向卡片流：滑动松手后自动停稳在最近一张并居中，当前这张最亮、两侧缩小变淡；底部小圆点跟着当前页走，点圆点也能翻页。",
  "usage": "3–8 张同级方案的横向浏览（推荐方案、模板 / 主题选择、套餐对比）；桌面和移动端都能用，移动端手感最好。",
  "caution": "卡片超过 10 张时改用列表或表格（滑不动也记不住）；需要逐项对比多列数据别用这种一次看一张的形式。",
  "hint": "左右拖动卡片流，松手会吸附到最近一张；点下面的圆点也能切换",
  "inspiration": "",
  "related": [],
  "prompt": "【滚动吸附卡片】目标：横向卡片列表，滑动停止时自动吸附到最近一张并居中；两侧卡片缩小变淡（scale .9 / opacity .6），当前卡片全亮，底部小圆点跟随当前页，点圆点也能切到对应卡片。**必须支持鼠标按住拖拽**（原生 scroll-snap 只吃滚轮和触摸，桌面用户主要用鼠标拖）。\n\n1) 结构：`.wrap`（纵向：标题行 + 横向 `.track` + 底部 `.dots`）；`.track` 是 flex 横向滚动容器（`overflow-x:auto; overflow-y:hidden; display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; cursor:grab; touch-action:pan-y`），卡片 `.card` 是 `flex:0 0 220px`。\n2) 吸附（用原生 CSS 打底）：`.track` 上 `scroll-snap-type:x mandatory`，卡片上 `scroll-snap-align:center`；track 左右 padding 用 `calc((100% - 220px) / 2)`，这样第一张和最后一张也能滚到正中。\n3) 当前卡片视觉：默认 `transform:scale(.9); opacity:.6`，`.card.active` 时 `transform:none; opacity:1`，并加主色 40% 透明边框 + 主色淡投影；过渡 0.28 秒 `cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)`（transform/opacity/border/box-shadow 一起过渡）。\n4) **鼠标拖拽（关键，缺了桌面没法用）**：\n   - `.track.dragging{cursor:grabbing;scroll-snap-type:none}` —— 拖拽期间必须临时关掉 snap，否则每次改 `scrollLeft` 都会被吸回去；同时 `.track.dragging .card{transition:none}`，否则卡片缩放动画拖慢手感。\n   - `pointerdown`：只处理左键（`e.button === 0`），记 `{x: clientX, sl: track.scrollLeft, id: pointerId}`、`dragMoved = false`、加 `.dragging`、`setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)`。\n   - `pointermove`：`dx = clientX - x`；`|dx| > 6` 时 `dragMoved = true`；`track.scrollLeft = sl - dx`（**手动滚，跟手**）。\n   - `pointerup/pointercancel`：移除 `.dragging`、`releasePointerCapture`；若 `dragMoved` 则下一帧算最近卡片并 `track.scrollTo({left: 目标, behavior:'smooth'})` 吸附。\n   - **拖拽后紧跟的 click 要吞掉**：`track.addEventListener('click', fn, true)` 捕获阶段里 `if(dragMoved){ stopPropagation(); preventDefault(); dragMoved = false; }`，否则会误触发卡片内部元素的点击。\n5) 滚动 → 圆点联动：scroll 监听（passive）+ `requestAnimationFrame` 节流，每帧比较每张卡中心与容器中心的距离，最近的设为 active，同步圆点和「N / M」计数。\n6) 点圆点 → `goTo(i)`：**定位不要用 offsetLeft**（会受 padding/offsetParent 影响），用 rect 算差：`delta = (卡中心 - 容器中心)`，`track.scrollLeft += delta`，再 `scrollTo({behavior:'smooth'})`。\n7) 演示（卡片预览自动播）：光标点下一个圆点（560ms 移动 → 按下 190ms → 松开后 goTo）→ 停约 1 秒 → 再点下一个 → 循环；弹窗里用户自己拖 / 点圆点。\n8) 无障碍：track 加 `tabindex=\"0\"` + `aria-label`「方案卡片，可左右滑动或按住拖动」；圆点 `role=\"tablist\"` / `role=\"tab\"` + `aria-selected`；计数 `aria-live=\"polite\"`。\n9) 坑：① 横向滚动条一定要隐藏 —— `::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}`，Firefox 的 `scrollbar-width:none` 必须包进 `@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar)`，否则 Chromium 会忽略 webkit 伪元素露出带箭头的系统滚动条；② scroll-snap 与 JS 的 smooth `scrollTo` 混用时，目标位置必须正好是 snap 点（居中位置），否则会被拉回看着像抖一下；③ 拖拽时必须临时 `scroll-snap-type:none`，否则拖不动；④ 拖拽阈值 6px 用来区分「点」和「拖」；⑤ 两侧卡片缩小后仍占布局宽度，gap 留 10px 够。\n10) 配色：卡片底 `--ui-surface`、边框 `color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent)`、激活边框主色 40%、图标底主色 14%、圆点用文字色 20% 透明、激活圆点 `--ui-brand`。\n11) 使用场景：3–8 张同级方案的横向浏览（推荐方案、模板/主题选择、套餐对比）；卡片 >10 张或需要逐项比较时改用列表/表格。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg)}\n\n.wrap{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:10px 0 8px}\n.head{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:7px;padding:0 14px}\n.head b{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600}\n.head .cnt{margin-left:auto;font-size:9px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n\n.track{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;overscroll-behavior-x:contain;padding:2px calc((100% - 220px) / 2);-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;cursor:grab;touch-action:pan-y}\n.track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;width:0;height:0}\n@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar){\n  .track{scrollbar-width:none}\n}\n/* 拖拽中：禁掉吸附和过渡，手势才跟得住 */\n.track.dragging{cursor:grabbing;scroll-snap-type:none}\n.track.dragging .card{transition:none}\n.track.dragging .card:not(.active){opacity:.75}\n\n.card{flex:0 0 220px;scroll-snap-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;padding:11px 12px;border-radius:12px;\n  border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent);\n  background:var(--ui-surface);\n  transform:scale(.9);opacity:.6;\n  transition:transform .28s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),opacity .28s ease,border-color .28s ease,box-shadow .28s ease}\n.card.active{transform:none;opacity:1;border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 40%,transparent);box-shadow:0 8px 20px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 14%,transparent)}\n.card .ico{width:22px;height:22px;flex:0 0 auto;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:7px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 14%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;font-style:normal}\n.card b{font-size:11px;font-weight:600}\n.card p{margin:0;font-size:8.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ui-text-dim);display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}\n.card .tag{align-self:flex-start;margin-top:1px;font-size:7.5px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:999px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 7%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n\n.dots{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;padding:0 14px}\n.dot{width:6px;height:6px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 20%,transparent);cursor:pointer;transition:width .2s ease,background .2s ease,transform .12s ease}\n.dot.on{width:14px;background:var(--ui-brand)}\n.dot.pressing{transform:scale(.82)}\n\n@media (min-height:421px){\n  .wrap{gap:14px;padding:20px 0 18px}\n  .head{padding:0 26px;gap:12px}\n  .head b{font-size:19px}\n  .head .cnt{font-size:13px}\n  .track{gap:18px;padding:4px calc((100% - 320px) / 2)}\n  .card{flex:0 0 320px;gap:10px;padding:20px 22px;border-radius:18px}\n  .card .ico{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:12px;font-size:17px}\n  .card b{font-size:19px}\n  .card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}\n  .card .tag{font-size:11px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px}\n  .dots{gap:9px;padding:0 26px}\n  .dot{width:9px;height:9px}\n  .dot.on{width:24px}\n}\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .wrap{gap:4px;padding:8px 0 6px}\n  .head{padding:0 10px}\n  .head b{font-size:10.5px}\n  .track{gap:8px;padding:2px calc((100% - 200px) / 2)}\n  .card{flex:0 0 200px;gap:4px;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:10px}\n  .card .ico{width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:6px;font-size:9px}\n  .card b{font-size:10px}\n  .card p{font-size:8px;-webkit-line-clamp:2}\n  .card .tag{font-size:7px;padding:1px 5px}\n  .dots{gap:4px;padding:0 10px}\n  .dot{width:5px;height:5px}\n  .dot.on{width:12px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .card,.dot{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><b>推荐方案</b><span class=\"cnt\" id=\"cnt\" aria-live=\"polite\">1 / 4</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"track\" id=\"track\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"方案卡片，可左右滑动或按住拖动\">\n    <div class=\"card active\"><i class=\"ico\">仪</i><b>仪表盘</b><p>数据总览和趋势图，适合每天打开看一眼的运营日报。</p><span class=\"tag\">概览</span></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"ico\">看</i><b>看板</b><p>任务按状态分组，拖拽就能流转，适合多人协作的迭代。</p><span class=\"tag\">协作</span></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"ico\">时</i><b>时间线</b><p>按时间排列的更新记录，回看某个版本改了什么最直观。</p><span class=\"tag\">记录</span></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"ico\">列</i><b>列表</b><p>信息密度高，适合批量勾选和快速扫读的表格型任务。</p><span class=\"tag\">批量</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dots\" id=\"dots\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"方案切换\">\n    <button class=\"dot on\" type=\"button\" data-i=\"0\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-label=\"第 1 个方案\"></button>\n    <button class=\"dot\" type=\"button\" data-i=\"1\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-label=\"第 2 个方案\"></button>\n    <button class=\"dot\" type=\"button\" data-i=\"2\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-label=\"第 3 个方案\"></button>\n    <button class=\"dot\" type=\"button\" data-i=\"3\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-label=\"第 4 个方案\"></button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var track = document.getElementById('track'),\n      cnt = document.getElementById('cnt'),\n      cards = [].slice.call(track.querySelectorAll('.card')),\n      dots = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.dot'));\n\n  var idx = 0, timers = [], cursor = null, cursorReady = false, ticking = false;\n  /* 鼠标拖拽状态 */\n  var drag = null, dragMoved = false;\n\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i = 0; i < timers.length; i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers = []; }\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursorReady) return cursor;\n    cursorReady = true;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n      setTimeout(function(){ if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 120);\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n  function showCursor(){ if(cursor && cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show'); }\n\n  function paint(){\n    for(var i = 0; i < cards.length; i++){\n      cards[i].classList.toggle('active', i === idx);\n      dots[i].classList.toggle('on', i === idx);\n      dots[i].setAttribute('aria-selected', i === idx ? 'true' : 'false');\n    }\n    cnt.textContent = (idx + 1) + ' / ' + cards.length;\n  }\n\n  function goTo(i){\n    var tr = track.getBoundingClientRect(),\n        cr = cards[i].getBoundingClientRect();\n    var delta = (cr.left + cr.width / 2) - (tr.left + tr.width / 2);\n    track.scrollTo({ left: track.scrollLeft + delta, behavior: 'smooth' });\n  }\n\n  function nearestIndex(){\n    var tr = track.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var center = tr.left + tr.width / 2;\n    var best = 0, bestD = Infinity;\n    for(var i = 0; i < cards.length; i++){\n      var r = cards[i].getBoundingClientRect();\n      var d = Math.abs(r.left + r.width / 2 - center);\n      if(d < bestD){ bestD = d; best = i; }\n    }\n    return best;\n  }\n  function detect(){\n    var best = nearestIndex();\n    if(best !== idx){ idx = best; paint(); }\n  }\n\n  track.addEventListener('scroll', function(){\n    if(ticking) return;\n    ticking = true;\n    requestAnimationFrame(function(){ ticking = false; detect(); });\n  }, { passive: true });\n\n  /* ── 鼠标 / 触屏按住拖动（原生 scroll-snap 只吃滚轮和触摸，桌面鼠标拖不动）── */\n  track.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(e){\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive) return;\n    if(e.button !== undefined && e.button !== 0) return;   /* 只处理左键 */\n    drag = { x: e.clientX, sl: track.scrollLeft, id: e.pointerId };\n    dragMoved = false;\n    track.classList.add('dragging');\n    try{ track.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); }catch(err){}\n  });\n  track.addEventListener('pointermove', function(e){\n    if(!drag) return;\n    var dx = e.clientX - drag.x;\n    if(Math.abs(dx) > 6) dragMoved = true;               /* 超过 6px 才算拖拽，避免误触发卡片点击 */\n    track.scrollLeft = drag.sl - dx;                     /* 手动滚：跟手，不靠 snap */\n    if(dragMoved) e.preventDefault();\n  });\n  function endDrag(e){\n    if(!drag) return;\n    var moved = dragMoved;\n    drag = null;\n    track.classList.remove('dragging');\n    try{ if(e && e.pointerId != null) track.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId); }catch(err){}\n    if(moved){\n      /* 松手吸附到最近一张：先算出目标位置再平滑滚过去 */\n      requestAnimationFrame(function(){\n        var i = nearestIndex();\n        idx = i; paint();\n        goTo(i);\n      });\n    }\n  }\n  track.addEventListener('pointerup', endDrag);\n  track.addEventListener('pointercancel', endDrag);\n  /* 拖过之后紧跟的 click 要吞掉，否则会点到卡片内部元素 */\n  track.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n    if(dragMoved){ e.stopPropagation(); e.preventDefault(); dragMoved = false; }\n  }, true);\n\n  for(var i = 0; i < dots.length; i++){\n    (function(n){\n      dots[n].addEventListener('click', function(){ goTo(n); });\n    })(i);\n  }\n\n  function tap(el, done){\n    if(!cursor){ done && done(); return; }\n    showCursor();\n    cursor.moveTo(el);\n    later(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      el.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        el.classList.remove('pressing');\n        done && done();\n      }, 190);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimers();\n    ensureCursor();\n    if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide();\n    paint();\n    if(!cursor){\n      later(function(){ goTo((idx + 1) % cards.length); }, 900);\n      later(demoCycle, 2800);\n      return;\n    }\n    var next = (idx + 1) % cards.length;\n    later(function(){\n      tap(dots[next], function(){ goTo(next); });\n    }, 500);\n    later(function(){ if(typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 2400);\n    later(demoCycle, 3400);\n  }\n\n  paint();\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){\n    detect();\n  } else {\n    setTimeout(demoCycle, 300);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
  "createdAt": 1794379455948,
  "updatedAt": 1794685310605
}